/ ============================================================================
/ FLEXI ADMIN EXAMPLE: New Form Template
/ ============================================================================
/ The new form is rendered by the controller's `new` action.
/ It uses the same form DSL as the edit form, but POSTs to the create action.
/ ============================================================================

= form url: admin_users_path, method: :post do
  = text_field 'user[full_name]', label: 'Full Name', value: -> { resource.full_name }, required: true
  = text_field 'user[email]', label: 'Email', value: -> { resource.email }, required: true
  = text_field 'user[phone]', label: 'Phone', value: -> { resource.phone }
  = text_field 'user[personal_number]', label: 'Personal Number', value: -> { resource.personal_number }
  = submit
